00:22:51.140 --> 00:22:52.570
Warren 416: of LLMs.

210
00:22:53.720 --> 00:22:55.590
Warren 416: is private.

211
00:22:57.190 --> 00:23:04.569
Warren 416: What they mean is that the training of LLMs should not use their data.

