00:23:21.810 --> 00:23:22.710
Warren 416: Right?

216
00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:37.229
Warren 416: But again, it's not clearly identified, and in part, this is because of the way that people perceive it. You hear AI, and you think Claw, chat GPT, etc. I have a chat interface, I'm going to upload a data file, tell it to do something with it, which is literally what people do.

217
00:23:37.940 --> 00:23:41.049
Warren 416: But that's not the only way to use LLM stresses.

